 "_README": [
  "WHAT PLAYS WHEN. Hand-written; the exporter never touches this file, the",
  "same as rules.json, modifier_effects.json and intent_patterns.json.",
  "",
  "Nothing here has a sound yet, and that is deliberate: the wiring ships",
  "silent. Every entry below is already connected to the moment it names, so",
  "dropping an .ogg into assets/audio/ and writing its filename against the",
  "right key is the whole job. No code changes.",
  "",
  "A key with an empty 'file' is a no-op. A key whose file is not there logs",
  "one quiet line the first time and is never mentioned again, exactly as",
  "ArtLoader does for art that has not been drawn.",
  "",
  "THE BUSES. Three, so they can be mixed and muted separately:",
  "  music   — the bed under a stage. One at a time, looped.",
  "  effects — a card, a gaffe, a turn ending.",
  "  speech  — spoken lines. Its own bus so it can duck the music later and",
  "            so a player who wants the words without the score can have",
  "            them.",
  "",
  "SPEECH is keyed by whoever is speaking, not by event, because a line",
  "belongs to a character, and then by line ID. Empty until Cameron records",
  "any. It would read:",
  "  \"speech\": { \"OP03\": { \"opening\": \"op03_opening.ogg\" } }",
  "",
  "2026-09-21: the speech table is now filled in, under PC01, with one",
  "key per card cue — C01_1 through C54_5, matching the five columns of the",
  "workbook's Flavor Text tab. Every filename is empty, so the game is still",
  "silent; recording a line is writing its filename against the key, and the",
  "battle screen already calls for it at the moment the card is played.",
  "Opponents' lines go in beside PC01 under their own opp_id.",
  "",
  "Each of the four protagonists (player.json, PC01-PC04) speaks under their",
  "own ID. Only PC01's table is written out; a protagonist with no table is",
  "silent, the same as a missing file. Copy PC01's block to start another."
 ],
 "sounds": {
  "card_played": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "any card leaves the hand"
  },
  "card_useless": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "a card was played that this room ignores"
  },
  "turn_started": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "the player's turn opens"
  },
  "turn_ended": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "End turn is pressed"
  },
  "intent_revealed": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "the opponent's next move becomes known"
  },
  "gaffe": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "the gaffe meter rises"
  },
  "gaffe_final": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "one more gaffe would end the stage"
  },
  "meta_up": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "a standing rose"
  },
  "meta_down": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "a standing fell"
  },
  "xp_gained": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "XP was earned"
  },
  "xp_spent": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "effects",
   "when": "XP was spent in the Office"
  },
  "battle_won": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "music",
   "when": "the stage is carried",
   "loop": false
  },
  "battle_lost": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "music",
   "when": "the stage is lost",
   "loop": false
  },
  "music_office": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "music",
   "when": "asked for by name",
   "loop": true
  },
  "music_battle": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "music",
   "when": "asked for by name",
   "loop": true
  },
  "music_title": {
   "file": "",
   "bus": "music",
   "when": "asked for by name",
   "loop": true
  }
 },
